        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Castille has invaded the island! Assemble a team of 4 Engkanto Girls (Monster Girls) and engage in strategic turn-based combat against the Castille and other corrupted engkanto girls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~Gameplay~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features the classic turn-based battles with beautiful and cute monster girls based on Philippine mythos and legends. There's 4 default Engkanto Girls and 16 unlockable ones using special currency gained throughout the game. There are also 53 different 4<strong>★ </strong>equipment (late-game legendary items) and 100 mementos (unique equipment, each of the engkanto girls have 5) that can shape the way you play your Engkanto Girls. There are 18 bosses/ boss teams, 21 mini-bosses/mini-boss teams with unique mechanics tied to them.<br><br>The game is also divided into 2 parts: The <strong>Pre-Hardmode</strong> early game where you can fish for 3<strong>★ </strong> and 4<strong>★ </strong>equipment in special blessings, collect gold and other currencies, and get a feel for the gameplay. And then there's <strong>Hardmode</strong>, only unlocked when the first 8 bosses are defeated, unlocking<strong> </strong>better items, equipment, harder difficulty battles, and inching towards the final boss of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4223720/extras/7e8c4bfccfc60c362e988ef7bae1e400.avif?t=1766750407\" width=1200 height=624 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~Difficulty~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make no mistake about thinking this is just a simple &quot;cast skill immediately when available&quot; kind of turn-based game. This game requires strategy, understanding of the skill descriptions, and a lot of theory-crafting. Finding the best team and the best combo for a particular dungeon and/or boss.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Castille has invaded the island! Assemble a team of 4 Engkanto Girls (Monster Girls) and engage in strategic turn-based combat against the Castille and other corrupted engkanto girls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~Gameplay~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features the classic turn-based battles with beautiful and cute monster girls based on Philippine mythos and legends. There's 4 default Engkanto Girls and 16 unlockable ones using special currency gained throughout the game. There are also 53 different 4<strong>★ </strong>equipment (late-game legendary items) and 100 mementos (unique equipment, each of the engkanto girls have 5) that can shape the way you play your Engkanto Girls. There are 18 bosses/ boss teams, 21 mini-bosses/mini-boss teams with unique mechanics tied to them.<br><br>The game is also divided into 2 parts: The <strong>Pre-Hardmode</strong> early game where you can fish for 3<strong>★ </strong> and 4<strong>★ </strong>equipment in special blessings, collect gold and other currencies, and get a feel for the gameplay. And then there's <strong>Hardmode</strong>, only unlocked when the first 8 bosses are defeated, unlocking<strong> </strong>better items, equipment, harder difficulty battles, and inching towards the final boss of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4223720/extras/7e8c4bfccfc60c362e988ef7bae1e400.avif?t=1766750407\" width=1200 height=624 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~Difficulty~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make no mistake about thinking this is just a simple &quot;cast skill immediately when available&quot; kind of turn-based game. This game requires strategy, understanding of the skill descriptions, and a lot of theory-crafting. Finding the best team and the best combo for a particular dungeon and/or boss.</p>",
